'''Li'l Gau''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Update 2.0.6|Version 2.0.6]] and can be obtained during the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]] improves his health and grants knockback immunity.

